A repeated definition: which one wins

```
see [t][r].

[r]: /a

[r]: /b
.
<p>see <a href="/b">t</a>.</p>
```

```
*[A]: a
*[A]: b

A here.
.
<p><abbr title="b">A</abbr> here.</p>
```

```
see [^f].

[^f]: one

[^f]: two
.
